SUMMARY:🎶 Donor Network West | 16th Annual Stride for Hope 5K
LOCATION:East Bay Venue\, Contra Costa
DESCRIPTION:Donor Network West invites the community to Stride for Hope\, a meaningful 5K run or walk dedicated to honoring donors\, celebrating recipients\, and supporting those still waiting for a lifesaving transplant.\n\nHeld on Saturday\, September 12\, 2026\, at 7:30 AM at Rancho San Ramon Community Park\, the event will feature music\, inspiring stories\, family-friendly activities\, and opportunities to celebrate https://www.bishopranch.com/br-event/donor-network-west-16th-annual-stride-for-hope-5k/
URL:https://www.bishopranch.com/br-event/donor-network-west-16th-annual-stride-for-hope-5k/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
