DTSTAMP:20260913T054240Z
DTSTART:20260912T153000Z
DTEND:20260912T170000Z
SUMMARY:🎪 Beer City Run Bishop Ranch
LOCATION:2600 Camino Ramon\, San Ramon
DESCRIPTION:Beer City returns to Bishop Ranch with a full day of racing\, local brews\, and community celebration. The event kicks off with the Beer City Half Marathon\, 10K\, and 5K\, followed by an afternoon festival featuring top East Bay breweries\, live music\, and local food vendors.\n&nbsp\;\nGuests can also enjoy the fan-favorite Beat the Beast beer mile challenge\, explore local taprooms via the Beer City Troll https://www.bishopranch.com/br-event/beer-city-run-bishop-ranch/
URL:https://www.bishopranch.com/br-event/beer-city-run-bishop-ranch/
END:VEVENT
